  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "An AC&nbsp;circuit has an inductor and a resistor of resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> in series, such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></math>. Now, a capacitor is added in series such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></math>. the ratio of the new power factor with the old power factor of the circuit is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>First Recall the formula of power factor,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>Z</mi></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mi>initial</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>Z</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><msup><mfenced><msub><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>Z</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mi>initial</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
